    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very simple but exciting game that you can play while talking on the phone with a friend or at a meeting, helps you concentrate. And also a very powerful tool for developing memory and attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does not depend on donations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No dropped items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No achievements to complete! (only one when starting and closing the game for the first time)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is done so that the player immerses himself and is imbued with the idea of \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bthis game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play, get credits and as they accumulate, open a new level, for each new level a unique animated theme is given - a background!</p>",
